Port of _patches/typescript/035-checker-base-constraint-identity.patch.
The constraint stack uses the normalized parameter type rather than its symbol for indexed accesses.
Shared recursion identities and cycle/depth limits remain unchanged.
The target-normalization helper is crate-visible solely for this sibling-module call.

diff --git a/crates/tsrs_checker/src/checker_13.rs b/crates/tsrs_checker/src/checker_13.rs
